# Raw input: Photorealistic depiction of Murchison Falls in Uganda, capturing the immense power of the river as it crashes through the narrow gorge. The subject is the massive waterfall with multiple tiers, creating a colossal curtain of white water plunging into the deep gorge. Surrounding environment features lush, vibrant green rainforest with towering trees and dense undergrowth on both sides, while the river below flows with deep turquoise waters. The mood is awe-inspiring and majestic, with mist rising from the falls creating a soft, ethereal atmosphere. Lighting is bright, golden-hour sunlight filtering through the canopy, casting long shadows and illuminating the spray with a warm glow. Colors are rich: emerald greens, deep blues of the water, and the stark white of the falling water contrast with dark, moss-covered rocks. Textures include the rough, wet rock surfaces, smooth water flow, and delicate misty spray. Artistic style: hyper-realistic with cinematic composition, emphasizing natural grandeur. Quality tags: 8k resolution, ultra HD, sharp focus, extreme detail, photorealistic.
